[1m[38;5;231mHow should the shared validation module be loaded?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mES modules (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mimport/export; index.html switches to <script type="module">. Testable in Node as-is, no bundler. Requires serving
[39m     [38;5;246mthe page over HTTP.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Global namespace
     [38;5;246mPlain script tag exposing window.Validation. Nothing about page loading changes and file:// still works, at the [39m
     [38;5;246mcost of a global and harder testing.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m CommonJS + bundler
     [38;5;246mMatches src/'s require style, but introduces a build step this project doesn't currently have.[39m
